  "description": "A quick reminder of things to watch",
  "body_html": "<p>A quick reminder, if you did not see last week’s video, A <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-to-buy-mondaypossibly\">Stock to Buy Monday…Possibly</a></strong></em>, I do have a stop limit buy order set at $55.78 for the stock mentioned at the end of the video. This would be a price taking out local highs, increasing the probability that trend and momentum will continue upwards. I want to catch that train as it is passing by, in the direction I want. If it doesn’t fill…well, no money lost. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sIEN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ce109e7-09de-48d8-b4e5-a34ac544f9f6_640x358.gif\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sIEN!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ce109e7-09de-48d8-b4e5-a34ac544f9f6_640x358.gif 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sIEN!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ce109e7-09de-48d8-b4e5-a34ac544f9f6_640x358.gif 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sIEN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ce109e7-09de-48d8-b4e5-a34ac544f9f6_640x358.gif 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sIEN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ce109e7-09de-48d8-b4e5-a34ac544f9f6_640x358.gif 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sIEN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazo