nBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Attempt to hop onto trains (stocks) already moving the direction you want. This is an attempt, and increased probability, you will get into a winning position quickly. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Overall, we have remained fairly light in the stock market, since the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-warning-signal?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Warning Signals</a> appeared on September 29<sup>th</sup>. I do not, nor do I imagine you, want to be throwing money at assets that just go sideways, or worse, go down. Are some stocks going up? Yea, of course, but it has not been the BROAD trend. And hence, probabilities of success are lower. We target the best set ups when markets are working for us!</p><p>The VIX, locally, has been trending upwards, something we do not want to see….but no major breakouts. It appears to mostly be retests (thats a good thing, for now.) I would also like to see S&amp;P 500 futures get back near all time highs, around $6953. At that point we can decide whether we want to get more aggressive. Our initial position with the Russell 2000, ETF <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$IWM&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is just consolidating at the moment. When and if it breaks to the upside out of that consolidation, expect me to DCA UP. 🆙 </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2ka8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa186598b-b337-42f9-b1c7-5f89b5e61d8f_3358x1690.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2ka8!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa186598b-b337-42f9-b1c7-5f89b5e61d8f_3358x1690.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2ka8!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa186598b-b337-42f9-b1c7-5f89b5e61d8f_3358x1690.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2ka8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa186598b-b337-42f9-b1c7-5f89b5e61d8f_3358x1690.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2ka8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa186598b-b337-42f9-b1c7-5